        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine asks for the file and gives its own name and version number. It sends no cookie, no identifier and no address of a page you came from, and keeps nothing of the exchange afterwards."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine demande le fichier et donne son nom et son numéro de version. Elle n’envoie aucun cookie, aucun identifiant, aucune adresse de provenance, et ne garde rien de l’échange ensuite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine can open two connections, and this is one of them. The other one looks for a new version. Nothing about your documents, your searches or your Mac is sent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine can open two connections, and this is one of them. The other one looks for a new version. Nothing about your documents, your searches or your Mac is sent."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine sait ouvrir deux connexions, et voici l’une d’elles. L’autre cherche une nouvelle version. Rien de vos documents, de vos recherches ou de votre Mac n’est envoyé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine cannot read or create its index file. Check that the disk is not read-only and that Fouine is allowed to access its folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine cannot read or create its index file. Check that the disk is not read-only and that Fouine is allowed to access its folder."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne peut ni lire ni créer son fichier d’index. Vérifiez que le disque n’est pas en lecture seule et que Fouine a accès à son dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine checks your folders from time to time and updates the index by itself, even when its window is closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine checks your folders from time to time and updates the index by itself, even when its window is closed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine vérifie vos dossiers de temps en temps et met l’index à jour toute seule, même quand sa fenêtre est fermée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine connects to nothing until you ask it to. This switch is off to begin with, and while it is off nothing goes out unless you click “Check now”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine connects to nothing until you ask it to. This switch is off to begin with, and while it is off nothing goes out unless you click “Check now”."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne se connecte à rien tant que vous ne le demandez pas. Cet interrupteur est éteint au départ, et tant qu’il l’est, rien ne sort sans que vous cliquiez « Rechercher maintenant »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine contacts the shop at three moments only: when you activate this Mac, when you release it, and once a month to check that your key is still valid. It sends your key and the name of this Mac, so you can tell your Macs apart the day you want to free one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine contacts the shop at three moments only: when you activate this Mac, when you release it, and once a month to check that your key is still valid. It sends your key and the name of this Mac, so you can tell your Macs apart the day you want to free one."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne contacte la boutique qu’à trois moments : quand vous activez ce Mac, quand vous le libérez, et une fois par mois pour vérifier que votre clé est toujours valable. Elle envoie votre clé et le nom de ce Mac, pour que vous sachiez lequel libérer le jour venu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine copies the text of your notes into its own folder so it can search them; nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine copies the text of your notes into its own folder so it can search them; nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine copie le texte de vos notes dans son propre dossier pour pouvoir les chercher ; rien ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not change this setting (%@).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not change this setting (%@)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu changer ce réglage (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not check whether a newer version exists. Try again later. Fouine keeps working as it is.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not check whether a newer version exists. Try again later. Fouine keeps working as it is."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu vérifier s’il existe une version plus récente. Réessayez plus tard. Fouine continue de fonctionner telle quelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not read this file, without saying why.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not read this file, without saying why."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu lire ce fichier, sans dire pourquoi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not read what it skips in this folder: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not read what it skips in this folder: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu lire ce qu’elle ignore dans ce dossier : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not read where the words are on this scanned page: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not read where the words are on this scanned page: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu lire où se trouvent les mots sur cette page scannée : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not read your notes (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not read your notes (%@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu lire vos notes (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not schedule this page to be read again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not schedule this page to be read again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu programmer la relecture de cette page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not update its licence file. Check that your disk is not full, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not update its licence file. Check that your disk is not full, then try again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu enregistrer vos informations de licence. Vérifiez qu’il reste de la place sur le disque, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine could not update Spotlight (%@)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine could not update Spotlight (%@)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas pu mettre Spotlight à jour (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine does not know how to read this kind of file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine does not know how to read this kind of file."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne sait pas lire ce type de fichier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine does not know this document": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine does not know this document"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne connaît pas ce document"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine first shows the best cards of each deck, so that a single one does not fill the whole list. Click to see every card found in this deck.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine first shows the best cards of each deck, so that a single one does not fill the whole list. Click to see every card found in this deck."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine montre d’abord les meilleures cartes de chaque paquet, pour qu’un seul ne remplisse pas toute la liste. Cliquez pour voir toutes les cartes trouvées dans ce paquet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine first shows the best pages of each document, so that a single one does not fill the whole list. Click to see every page found in this document.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine first shows the best pages of each document, so that a single one does not fill the whole list. Click to see every page found in this document."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine montre d’abord les meilleures pages de chaque document, pour qu’un seul ne remplisse pas toute la liste. Cliquez pour voir toutes les pages trouvées dans ce document."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine Guide": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine Guide"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guide de Fouine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine has not indexed anything yet. Open Fouine and add a folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine has not indexed anything yet. Open Fouine and add a folder."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a encore rien lu. Ouvrez Fouine et ajoutez un dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine has not opened your index yet. Open Fouine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine has not opened your index yet. Open Fouine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas encore ouvert votre index. Ouvrez Fouine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine has read these pages as well as it can: reading them again would give the same result. If a document is written in a language that is not ticked in Settings ▸ Indexing, tick it, then right-click the page in the preview and choose “Read this page again”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine has read these pages as well as it can: reading them again would give the same result. If a document is written in a language that is not ticked in Settings ▸ Indexing, tick it, then right-click the page in the preview and choose “Read this page again”."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine a lu ces pages du mieux qu’elle peut : les relire donnerait le même résultat. Si un document est écrit dans une langue qui n’est pas cochée dans Réglages ▸ Indexation, cochez-la, puis faites un clic droit sur la page dans l’aperçu et choisissez « Relire cette page »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine is already preparing the meaning of your documents, in another window or in Terminal. Wait for that work to finish.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine is already preparing the meaning of your documents, in another window or in Terminal. Wait for that work to finish."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine prépare déjà le sens de vos documents, dans une autre fenêtre ou dans le Terminal. Attendez la fin de ce travail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine is not allowed to read %@. Results already indexed stay searchable, but preview and indexing are impossible. To allow it: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine is not allowed to read %@. Results already indexed stay searchable, but preview and indexing are impossible. To allow it: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas l’autorisation de lire %1$@. Les résultats déjà indexés restent consultables, mais l’aperçu et l’indexation sont impossibles. Pour l’autoriser : %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine is not allowed to read these notes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine is not allowed to read these notes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas le droit de lire ces notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine is not allowed to read “%@”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine is not allowed to read “%@”"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’a pas le droit de lire « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine is not running from Fouine.app: automatic updates only apply to an installed application.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine is not running from Fouine.app: automatic updates only apply to an installed application."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne tourne pas depuis Fouine.app : les mises à jour automatiques ne s’appliquent qu’à une application installée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine leaves these out of the index. Your files stay where they are, untouched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine leaves these out of the index. Your files stay where they are, untouched."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine laisse ces éléments hors de l’index. Vos fichiers restent où ils sont, intacts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine link": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine link"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lien Fouine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine listens on this Mac and writes down the words. Nothing is sent anywhere. Count roughly the length of the recording, and install the language under System Settings ▸ Keyboard ▸ Dictation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine listens on this Mac and writes down the words. Nothing is sent anywhere. Count roughly the length of the recording, and install the language under System Settings ▸ Keyboard ▸ Dictation."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine écoute sur ce Mac et met les mots par écrit. Rien n’est envoyé ailleurs. Comptez à peu près la durée de l’enregistrement, et installez la langue dans Réglages Système ▸ Clavier ▸ Dictée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine must be installed in the Applications folder for automatic updates to work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine must be installed in the Applications folder for automatic updates to work."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine doit être installée dans le dossier Applications pour que la mise à jour automatique fonctionne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine on this Mac": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine on this Mac"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine sur ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine only recognises the languages installed on this Mac. Ticking several makes reading slower; ticking none is refused.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine only recognises the languages installed on this Mac. Ticking several makes reading slower; ticking none is refused."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne reconnaît que les langues installées sur ce Mac. En cocher plusieurs ralentit la lecture ; n’en cocher aucune est refusé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine only updates the index when you ask.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine only updates the index when you ask."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine ne met l’index à jour que lorsque vous le demandez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine read every document in your folders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine read every document in your folders."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine a lu tous les documents de vos dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine reads every page once more to make search by meaning possible. Nothing leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine reads every page once more to make search by meaning possible. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine relit chaque page une fois de plus pour rendre la recherche par le sens possible. Rien ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine reads the text of photographed documents; shop signs, labels and decorative lettering often escape it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine reads the text of photographed documents; shop signs, labels and decorative lettering often escape it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine lit le texte des documents photographiés ; les enseignes, les étiquettes et les écritures décoratives lui échappent souvent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine reads these folders without ever modifying them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine reads these folders without ever modifying them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine lit ces dossiers sans jamais les modifier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine reads your documents on this Mac and nothing leaves it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine reads your documents on this Mac and nothing leaves it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine lit vos documents sur ce Mac, et rien n’en sort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine result": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine result"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Résultat Fouine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine searches the text inside your documents (PDF, EPUB, DOCX, scanned pages) and takes you to the exact page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine searches the text inside your documents (PDF, EPUB, DOCX, scanned pages) and takes you to the exact page."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine cherche dans le texte de vos documents (PDF, EPUB, DOCX, pages scannées) et vous rend la page exacte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine skips nothing in this folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine skips nothing in this folder."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine n’ignore rien dans ce dossier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine starts with your session and stays in the menu bar, without opening a window.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine starts with your session and stays in the menu bar, without opening a window."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine démarre avec votre session et reste dans la barre des menus, sans ouvrir de fenêtre."
