        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine takes care of it in the background, when the Mac is plugged in and idle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine takes care of it in the background, when the Mac is plugged in and idle."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine s’en occupe toute seule, quand l’ordinateur est branché et au repos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine tells you when the last scanned page has been read (Fouine must be open).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine tells you when the last scanned page has been read (Fouine must be open)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine vous prévient quand la dernière page scannée a été lue (Fouine doit être ouverte)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine undoes what it installed on this Mac, and nothing else. **No indexed folder is touched**: Fouine has never written inside them, not even to store recognised text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine undoes what it installed on this Mac, and nothing else. **No indexed folder is touched**: Fouine has never written inside them, not even to store recognised text."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine défait ce qu’elle a installé sur ce Mac, et rien d’autre. **Aucun dossier indexé n’est touché** : Fouine n’y a jamais écrit, pas même pour y déposer le texte reconnu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fouine updates the index by itself when your documents change. These three conditions stop it from taking the Mac, or the battery, away from you. Unticking one lets it work anyway.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine updates the index by itself when your documents change. These three conditions stop it from taking the Mac, or the battery, away from you. Unticking one lets it work anyway."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fouine met l’index à jour toute seule quand vos documents changent. Ces trois conditions l’empêchent de vous prendre le Mac, ou la batterie. En décocher une la laisse travailler quand même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
