          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est en dehors des dossiers que Fouine surveille : Fouine ne l’ouvrira pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It keeps the Mac busy for a while: plug it in. You can stop at any time and resume later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It keeps the Mac busy for a while: plug it in. You can stop at any time and resume later."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela occupe le Mac un moment : branchez-le. Vous pouvez arrêter à tout instant et reprendre plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have been moved or renamed, or it is no longer in one of the folders Fouine watches. Run an indexing pass to bring the list up to date.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It may have been moved or renamed, or it is no longer in one of the folders Fouine watches. Run an indexing pass to bring the list up to date."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a peut-être été déplacé ou renommé, ou il n’est plus dans l’un des dossiers que Fouine surveille. Lancez une mise à jour pour rafraîchir la liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It reads your files without ever modifying them: no document and no search query ever leaves this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It reads your files without ever modifying them: no document and no search query ever leaves this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle lit vos fichiers sans jamais les modifier : aucun document, aucune requête de recherche ne quitte ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It takes %@ on disk. Your documents are not copied there: Fouine only keeps their text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It takes %@ on disk. Your documents are not copied there: Fouine only keeps their text."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il occupe %@ sur le disque. Vos documents n’y sont pas copiés : Fouine n’en garde que le texte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will appear in the sidebar, under “Saved searches”. Only what you typed is kept, not the filters you clicked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
