    "One step left: Fouine must read every page once more to prepare search by meaning. Nothing leaves this Mac, and you can stop and start again whenever you like: it picks up where it left off. Until the first pages are ready, the switch above stays greyed out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One step left: Fouine must read every page once more to prepare search by meaning. Nothing leaves this Mac, and you can stop and start again whenever you like: it picks up where it left off. Until the first pages are ready, the switch above stays greyed out."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il reste une étape : Fouine doit relire chaque page une fois de plus pour préparer la recherche par le sens. Rien ne quitte ce Mac, et vous pouvez arrêter puis recommencer quand vous voulez : la préparation reprend où elle s’était arrêtée. Tant qu’aucune page n’est prête, l’interrupteur ci-dessus reste grisé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One thing is left to do in Terminal; the command has been copied to the clipboard:\n\n%@": {
