        }
      }
    },
    "That request carries no identifier, nothing about this Mac and nothing about your documents: Fouine downloads a file and compares a version number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That request carries no identifier, nothing about this Mac and nothing about your documents: Fouine downloads a file and compares a version number."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette requête ne porte aucun identifiant, rien sur ce Mac et rien sur vos documents : Fouine télécharge un fichier et compare un numéro de version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ of the model folder are deleted. Search by meaning stops working until you download the model again. The pages already prepared stay in the index, ready for the day you install it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %@ of the model folder are deleted. Search by meaning stops working until you download the model again. The pages already prepared stay in the index, ready for the day you install it back."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les %@ du dossier du modèle sont supprimés. La recherche par le sens s’arrête jusqu’à un nouveau téléchargement. Les pages déjà préparées restent dans l’index, prêtes pour le jour où vous réinstallerez le modèle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The .fouineignore file in this folder already skips this.": {
