        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "le disque n’est pas branché : rebranchez-le et réessayez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Downloads folder needs a specific macOS permission: if indexing turns up nothing, grant it to Fouine in System Settings ▸ Privacy & Security ▸ Files and Folders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Downloads folder needs a specific macOS permission: if indexing turns up nothing, grant it to Fouine in System Settings ▸ Privacy & Security ▸ Files and Folders."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier Téléchargements exige une autorisation macOS spécifique : si l’indexation ne rend rien, accordez-la à Fouine dans Réglages Système ▸ Confidentialité et sécurité ▸ Fichiers et dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file looks damaged: nothing readable could be found in it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file looks damaged: nothing readable could be found in it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier semble abîmé : rien de lisible n’a pu y être trouvé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file was no longer there when Fouine tried to read it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file was no longer there when Fouine tried to read it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier n’était plus là quand Fouine a voulu le lire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder will be removed and its whole index deleted: documents, pages, and the text already read from its scans. Your files are not modified. To keep the index, disable the folder instead of removing it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder will be removed and its whole index deleted: documents, pages, and the text already read from its scans. Your files are not modified. To keep the index, disable the folder instead of removing it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier sera retiré et tout son index supprimé : documents, pages, et le texte déjà lu sur ses scans. Vos fichiers ne sont pas modifiés. Pour garder l’index, désactivez le dossier plutôt que de le retirer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder “%@”": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder “%@”"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The guide is not included in this copy of Fouine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The guide is not included in this copy of Fouine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le guide n’est pas fourni avec cette copie de Fouine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index file is damaged. Restore a backup if you have one; otherwise delete the file and Fouine will rebuild the index (this can take a long time).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The index file is damaged. Restore a backup if you have one; otherwise delete the file and Fouine will rebuild the index (this can take a long time)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier de l’index est abîmé. Restaurez une sauvegarde si vous en avez une ; sinon supprimez le fichier, et Fouine reconstruira l’index (cela peut être long)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index is already busy. Wait for the current job to finish.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
