            "value": "L’index est mis à jour par un autre programme. Fouine attend qu’il ait fini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index is being updated. Try again in a moment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The index is being updated. Try again in a moment."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’index est en train de se mettre à jour. Réessayez dans un instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index is kept up to date even when Fouine is closed. That is the job of the switch under “Index” in the main window.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The index is kept up to date even when Fouine is closed. That is the job of the switch under “Index” in the main window."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’index reste à jour même quand Fouine est fermée. C’est le rôle de l’interrupteur sous « Index », dans la fenêtre principale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index keeps updating by itself after Fouine is closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The index keeps updating by itself after Fouine is closed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’index continue de se mettre à jour tout seul après la fermeture de Fouine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index, its working files and the model for search by meaning. Rebuilding it means reading and recognising every document again, which can take hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The index, its working files and the model for search by meaning. Rebuilding it means reading and recognising every document again, which can take hours."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’index, ses fichiers de travail et le modèle de la recherche par le sens. Le reconstruire, c’est relire et reconnaître chaque document : cela peut prendre des heures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key was accepted, but Fouine could not save it. Check that your disk is not full, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key was accepted, but Fouine could not save it. Check that your disk is not full, then try again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé a été acceptée, mais Fouine n’a pas pu l’enregistrer. Vérifiez qu’il reste de la place sur le disque, puis réessayez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The licence service is unavailable right now. Your trial continues; try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The licence service is unavailable right now. Your trial continues; try again later."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service de licence est indisponible pour le moment. Votre essai continue ; réessayez plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log says what happened while the index was updating by itself: folders that could not be read, pages that failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The log says what happened while the index was updating by itself: folders that could not be read, pages that failed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal dit ce qui s’est passé pendant que l’index se mettait à jour tout seul : dossiers illisibles, pages en échec."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the meaning search is not ready yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the meaning search is not ready yet"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la recherche par le sens n’est pas encore prête"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The meaning search only adds its best pages: it has no total to announce.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The meaning search only adds its best pages: it has no total to announce."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recherche par le sens n’ajoute que ses meilleures pages : elle n’a pas de total à annoncer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The meaning search only covers the pages prepared for it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The meaning search only covers the pages prepared for it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recherche par le sens ne couvre que les pages préparées pour elle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message comes from Fouine itself: if Fouine is closed when the last page is read, there is none.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The message comes from Fouine itself: if Fouine is closed when the last page is read, there is none."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le message vient de Fouine : si Fouine est fermée quand la dernière page est lue, il n’y en a pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the model archive is not published yet for this version of Fouine (404): try again later, or install it from a local copy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the model archive is not published yet for this version of Fouine (404): try again later, or install it from a local copy."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "l’archive du modèle n’est pas encore publiée pour cette version de Fouine (404) : réessayez plus tard, ou installez-la depuis une copie locale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model has not been downloaded yet — Settings ▸ Search by meaning.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model has not been downloaded yet — Settings ▸ Search by meaning."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle n’a pas encore été téléchargé — Réglages ▸ Recherche par le sens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is not included in the application: it weighs as much as Fouine itself, and people who never search by meaning would carry it for nothing. Fouine downloads it when you ask, and checks the file before installing it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model is not included in the application: it weighs as much as Fouine itself, and people who never search by meaning would carry it for nothing. Fouine downloads it when you ask, and checks the file before installing it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle n’est pas livré avec l’application : il pèse autant que Fouine elle-même, et ceux qui ne cherchent jamais par le sens l’emporteraient pour rien. Fouine le télécharge quand vous le demandez, et vérifie le fichier avant de l’installer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model must be installed first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model must be installed first."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle doit d’abord être installé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address contacted, and the only one, is %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address contacted, and the only one, is %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse contactée, et la seule, est %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current page finishes cleanly and the queue stays intact: resuming will pick up here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current page finishes cleanly and the queue stays intact: resuming will pick up here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La page en cours se termine proprement, la file reste intacte : la reprise repartira d’ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The display filter hides the last pages loaded: the rest loads on demand.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The display filter hides the last pages loaded: the rest loads on demand."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le filtre d’affichage masque les dernières pages chargées : la suite se charge à la demande."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The label is this folder's name in the “Folders” facet and in “folder:…” queries.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The label is this folder's name in the “Folders” facet and in “folder:…” queries."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’étiquette est le nom de ce dossier dans la facette « Dossiers » et dans les requêtes « dossier:… »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last %lld queries run, each one click away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "The last query run, one click away."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "The last %lld queries run, each one click away."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "La dernière requête lancée, à relancer d’un choix."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Les %lld dernières requêtes lancées, à relancer d’un choix."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is missing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model is missing"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle est absent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pages left to read could not be counted (the database did not answer).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pages left to read could not be counted (the database did not answer)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pages restant à lire n’ont pas pu être comptées (la base n’a pas répondu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pass goes on. Its progress moves to the sidebar, where you can stop it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pass goes on. Its progress moves to the sidebar, where you can stop it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le travail continue. Sa progression passe dans la barre latérale, où vous pouvez l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The privacy permissions you granted stay listed in System Settings; macOS keeps them, and only you can remove them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The privacy permissions you granted stay listed in System Settings; macOS keeps them, and only you can remove them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les autorisations de confidentialité que vous avez accordées restent listées dans les Réglages Système ; macOS les conserve, et vous seul pouvez les retirer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanned pages of this document could not be read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The scanned pages of this document could not be read."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pages scannées de ce document n’ont pas pu être lues."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanned pages of this folder are read before those of the other folders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The scanned pages of this folder are read before those of the other folders."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pages scannées de ce dossier sont lues avant celles des autres dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The small icon at the top of the screen lets you search your documents and open Fouine. It also shows what the index is doing. While it is there, closing the window no longer quits Fouine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The small icon at the top of the screen lets you search your documents and open Fouine. It also shows what the index is doing. While it is there, closing the window no longer quits Fouine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La petite icône en haut de l’écran permet de chercher dans vos documents et d’ouvrir Fouine. Elle montre aussi ce que fait l’index. Tant qu’elle est là, fermer la fenêtre ne quitte plus Fouine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the update was stopped before this document was read": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the update was stopped before this document was read"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la mise à jour a été arrêtée avant que ce document ne soit lu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the whole index": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "the whole index"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
