          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording has no title or description, and what is said in it is not written down. Tick “Also write down what is said in them” in Settings ▸ Indexing to search it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recording has no title or description, and what is said in it is not written down. Tick “Also write down what is said in them” in Settings ▸ Indexing to search it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet enregistrement n’a ni titre ni description, et ce qui s’y dit n’est pas mis par écrit. Cochez « Mettre aussi par écrit ce qui est dit » dans Réglages ▸ Indexation pour y chercher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording is longer than the longest one Fouine writes down, and has no title or description. Raise “Longest recording to write down (minutes)” in Settings ▸ Indexing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This recording is longer than the longest one Fouine writes down, and has no title or description. Raise “Longest recording to write down (minutes)” in Settings ▸ Indexing."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet enregistrement dure plus longtemps que ce que Fouine met par écrit, et n’a ni titre ni description. Augmentez « Durée maximale mise par écrit (minutes) » dans Réglages ▸ Indexation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This result is no longer in Fouine. Search again.": {
