          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand mettre à jour automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you add your first folder, macOS will ask for permission to access it. Without that permission, Fouine cannot index it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you add your first folder, macOS will ask for permission to access it. Without that permission, Fouine cannot index it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au premier dossier ajouté, macOS vous demandera l’autorisation d’y accéder. Sans cette autorisation, Fouine ne peut pas l’indexer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it is installed": {
