    "Write down what is said in audio and video files, on this Mac. Slow, and needs a Dictation language installed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write down what is said in audio and video files, on this Mac. Slow, and needs a Dictation language installed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mettre par écrit ce qui est dit dans les fichiers son et vidéo, sur ce Mac. C’est lent, et il faut une langue de dictée installée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing down this recording was interrupted: speech recognition stopped responding. Fouine will try again if the file changes, or when an update improves speech recognition.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writing down this recording was interrupted: speech recognition stopped responding. Fouine will try again if the file changes, or when an update improves speech recognition."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La mise par écrit de cet enregistrement s’est interrompue : la reconnaissance vocale ne répondait plus. Fouine réessaiera si le fichier change, ou quand une mise à jour améliorera la reconnaissance vocale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "wrong SHA-256 fingerprint: the archive was refused and deleted. Expected %@, got %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wrong SHA-256 fingerprint: the archive was refused and deleted. Expected %@, got %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "empreinte SHA-256 incorrecte : archive refusée et supprimée. Attendu %@, obtenu %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Anki cards are not added as a folder: turn on Anki in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every card and keeps up with the new ones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Anki cards are not added as a folder: turn on Anki in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every card and keeps up with the new ones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos cartes Anki ne s’ajoutent pas comme un dossier : cochez Anki dans Réglages ▸ Dossiers, rubrique « Applications ». Fouine retrouve alors toutes vos cartes et suit les nouvelles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Apple Notes are not added as a folder: turn on Apple Notes in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every note and keeps up with the new ones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Apple Notes are not added as a folder: turn on Apple Notes in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every note and keeps up with the new ones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos notes d’Apple Notes ne s’ajoutent pas comme un dossier : cochez Apple Notes dans Réglages ▸ Dossiers, rubrique « Applications ». Fouine retrouve alors toutes vos notes et suit les nouvelles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Bear notes are not added as a folder: turn on Bear in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every note and keeps up with the new ones.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Bear notes are not added as a folder: turn on Bear in Settings ▸ Folders, under “Applications”. Fouine then finds every note and keeps up with the new ones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos notes de Bear ne s’ajoutent pas comme un dossier : cochez Bear dans Réglages ▸ Dossiers, rubrique « Applications ». Fouine retrouve alors toutes vos notes et suit les nouvelles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your disk has %@ left; your index uses %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your disk has %@ left; your index uses %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il reste %@ libres sur votre disque ; votre index en occupe %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your disk has only %@ left and your index uses %@: Fouine may run out of room to finish it. Free up some space, or remove a folder you no longer need": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your disk has only %@ left and your index uses %@: Fouine may run out of room to finish it. Free up some space, or remove a folder you no longer need"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ne reste que %@ libres sur votre disque et votre index en occupe %@ : Fouine risque de manquer de place pour le finir. Libérez de l’espace, ou retirez un dossier dont vous n’avez plus besoin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents are not touched, and Fouine keeps finding them. Only Spotlight forgets them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your documents are not touched, and Fouine keeps finding them. Only Spotlight forgets them."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos documents ne sont pas touchés, et Fouine continue de les trouver. Seul Spotlight les oublie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents stay where they are. Spotlight keeps its list on this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your documents stay where they are. Spotlight keeps its list on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos documents restent où ils sont. Spotlight garde sa liste sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` already exists and is not a symbolic link. Remove it yourself if you want Fouine to replace it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` already exists and is not a symbolic link. Remove it yourself if you want Fouine to replace it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` existe déjà et n’est pas un lien symbolique. Retirez-le vous-même si vous voulez que Fouine le remplace."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` already points at this copy of Fouine.\n\nCheck with: fouine --version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` already points at this copy of Fouine.\n\nCheck with: fouine --version"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` pointe déjà sur cette copie de Fouine.\n\nVérifiez avec : fouine --version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` is a real file, not a link made by Fouine: it is left alone. Remove it yourself if it is no longer wanted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` is a real file, not a link made by Fouine: it is left alone. Remove it yourself if it is no longer wanted."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` est un vrai fichier, pas un lien posé par Fouine : il est laissé en place. Supprimez-le vous-même s’il n’a plus lieu d’être."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` is left alone: it does not point inside this copy of Fouine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` is left alone: it does not point inside this copy of Fouine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` est laissé en place : il ne pointe pas dans cette copie de Fouine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` is moved to the Trash, then Fouine quits.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` is moved to the Trash, then Fouine quits."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` est mis à la corbeille, puis Fouine se ferme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` is not writable by Fouine, and the application never asks for an administrator password. The command below will be copied to the clipboard:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` is not writable by Fouine, and the application never asks for an administrator password. The command below will be copied to the clipboard:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` n’est pas inscriptible par Fouine, et l’application ne demande jamais de mot de passe administrateur. La commande ci-dessous sera copiée dans le presse-papiers :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`%@` now points at this copy of Fouine.\n\nOpen a terminal and try: fouine search \"your term\"\nThe CLI and the app share the same database.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` now points at this copy of Fouine.\n\nOpen a terminal and try: fouine search \"your term\"\nThe CLI and the app share the same database."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "`%@` pointe maintenant sur cette copie de Fouine.\n\nOuvrez un terminal et essayez : fouine search \"votre terme\"\nLa CLI et l’app partagent la même base."
          }
        }
      }
    },
